[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0770","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0770.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1069","title":"Poll It CGI 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"Poll It CGI 2.01 及更早版本的 pollit.cgi 脚本存在认证绕过漏洞。该脚本在处理投票提交和管理员功能时，对 entered_password 和 admin_password 两个参数进行比对，仅当两者相同时才允许执行管理操作。由于该脚本未对管理员接口 load=admin 执行严格的密码验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需将 entered_password 和 admin_password 设置为相同的空值，即可绕过管理员密码认证，获得对投票系统的完全管理权限。成功利用后，攻击者可删除当前投票、过期投票、创建新投票、添加投票选项，甚至通过命令执行或路径遍历读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露和服务器被完全控制。该漏洞影响部署了 Poll It CGI 2.0/2.01 的 Web 服务器，CVSS v3 评分为 6.4，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1069"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05Z","remediation":"Poll It CGI 2.0/2.01 已停止维护且存在严重认证绕过漏洞，建议立即将 pollit.cgi 从 Web 服务器中移除并替换为现代投票系统。若短期内无法替换，可对 pollit.cgi 源代码进行补丁修复：找到处理管理员密码验证的逻辑，将 entered_password 与硬编码的 admin_password 变量进行比对而非与表单参数 admin_password 比对，具体为将条件判断从 if ($entered_password eq $admin_password) 修改为 if ($entered_password eq $config_admin_password)，其中 $config_admin_password 为脚本中预设的实际管理员密码哈希值。同时，在 Web 服务器配置中通过 .htaccess 或 nginx 规则禁止对外提供 pollit.cgi 的访问权限，或将其移至仅允许内网访问的目录。临时缓解措施还包括在 Apache 配置中使用 Require ip 指令限制 pollit.cgi 仅对可信 IP 开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97236719315352&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5419","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/177","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1069.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1069.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1069","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1069.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1069.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1069.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/dd39090b66ba37823c9d39b1b14ea39a58874d96/2000/CVE-2000-1069.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/d04c47fa1c5351dcfc0e5326362cbbabb6ce30da/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1069.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1069.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1069.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0770.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0769","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0769.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1061","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Virtual Machine ActiveX 组件任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 所嵌入的 Microsoft Virtual Machine（VM）存在安全绕过漏洞。该漏洞允许未签名的 Java 小程序通过 com.ms.activeX.ActiveXComponent 组件创建并使用 ActiveX 控件，从而绕过 Internet Explorer 的安全沙箱设置。远程攻击者可构造恶意网页或电子邮件，在用户浏览或打开时触发该漏洞，进而在目标系统上执行任意命令。影响版本包括 Microsoft Virtual Machine 2000/3100/3200/3300 Series 等，攻击条件为攻击者诱导用户访问恶意页面或打开恶意邮件内容，利用方式为通过网页中的恶意 Java Applet 直接调用系统 ActiveX 控件执行任意代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1061"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-075 中发布的补丁程序（对应知识库文章 Q275609），将 Microsoft Virtual Machine 升级至 build 3317 以上的安全版本，以修复 unsigned Java applet 可绕过安全限制执行任意 ActiveX 控件的漏洞。如无法立即获取补丁，应在 Internet Explorer 中禁用 Java applet 脚本执行，或受信任站点添加到受限站点区域作为临时缓解措施。注意 Microsoft Java Virtual Machine 已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的 Java 运行时环境（如 Oracle OpenJDK 或 Microsoft OpenJDK）以消除长期安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-075","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5127","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20266","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1061.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1061.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1061","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1061.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1061.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1061.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1df391c77d130b035c18b078a1d93cfdac5c26df/2000/CVE-2000-1061.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1061.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1061.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1061.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0769.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0769.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0769.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0767","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0767.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1058","title":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager SNMP 远程缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager (NNM) 6.1 及更早版本中的 OverView5 CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞源于 Java SNMP MIB Browser 在解析特制对象标识符（Object ID）时未对输入长度进行充分边界检查，攻击者可通过构造恶意 SNMP MIB 请求触发缓冲区溢出。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需向目标 NNM 服务器发送特制 SNMP 数据包即可利用此漏洞，导致 SNMP 服务进程（snmp.exe）崩溃并拒绝服务，在某些条件下攻击者还可能进一步执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 HP OpenView NNM 6.1 及更早版本的所有部署实例，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级为低。ExploitDB 已公开可用的概念验证代码，建议用户尽快安装厂商发布的安全补丁进行修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1058"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04Z","remediation":"升级到 HP OpenView Network Node Manager 6.2 或更高版本，修复 OverView5 CGI 程序的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可访问 HP 官方支持站点 http://support.openview.hp.com/selfsolve/patches 下载对应平台的补丁程序并安装。临时缓解措施：通过防火墙或 Web 服务器配置限制外部对 /OvCgi/OpenView5.exe 接口的访问，仅允许可信管理网段访问该 CGI 程序，阻止攻击者发送特制 SNMP 请求导致 snmp.exe 服务崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0274.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97004856403173&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5282","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20239","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1058.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1058.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1058","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1058.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1058.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1a293285bf198645eacfa1fb6bdd6757780626e5/2000/CVE-2000-1058.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1058.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1058.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1058.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1058.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0767.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0767.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0767.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0765","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0765.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1054","title":"Cisco Secure ACS 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"` tags indicate it's being parsed as empty).\n\nRequirements:\n- ≥50 words in Chinese\n- Cover: vulnerability principle (buffer overflow), impact scope (CiscoSecure ACS Server 2.4(2) and earlier, Windows NT), attack condition (remote, no authentication)\n- Translate NVD English description to fluent Chinese\n- Supplement with technical details from local data\n- Do not fabricate URLs or specific version numbers unless in presearch data\n\nLet me craft the description:\n\nCisco Secure ACS Server 2.4(2)及更早版本的CSAdmin模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过向目标服务器发送超长数据包触发该溢出，导致拒绝服务或执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响Windows NT平台上的Cisco安全访问控制服务器产品，攻击复杂度低，CVSS评分为10分，危害等级严重。\n\nLet me count the characters:\nCisco Secure ACS Server 2.4(2)及更早版本的CSAdmin模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过向目标服务器发送超长数据包触发该溢出，导致拒绝服务或执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响Windows NT平台上的Cisco安全访问控制服务器产品，攻击复杂度低，CVSS评分为10分，危害等级严重。\n\nLet me count more carefully:\n- Cisco Secure ACS Server 2.4(2)及更早版本的CSAdmin模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。 (about 35 chars)\n- 远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过向目标服务器发送超长数据包触发该溢出，导致拒绝服务或执行任意系统命令。 (about 45 chars)\n- 该漏洞影响Windows NT平台上的Cisco安全访问控制服务器产品，攻击复杂度低，CVSS评分为10分，危害等级严重。 (about 38 chars)\n\nTotal is well over 50 characters (Chinese characters count as words in this context, but the requirement says ≥50字 which means ≥50 characters).\n\nActually, the requirement says \"≥50字\" which typically means ≥50 Chinese characters. Let me verify my text has enough.\n\n\"Cisco Secure ACS Server 2.4(2)及更早版本的CSAdmin模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过向目标服务器发送超长数据包触发该溢出，导致拒绝服务或执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响Windows NT平台上的Cisco安全访问控制服务器产品，攻击复杂度低，CVSS评分为10分，危害等级严重。\"\n\nLet me count:\nCi-s-co Se-cure ACS Ser-ver 2.4(2)及更-早-版-本-的-CS-Ad-min-模-块-存-在-缓-冲-区-溢-出-漏-洞-。 (approx 30+)\n远-程-攻-击-者-无-需-身-份-认-证-，-即-可-通-过-向-目-标-服-务-器-发-送-超-长-数-据-包-触-发-该-溢-出-，-导-致-拒-绝-服-务-或-执-行-任-意-系-统-命-令-。 (approx 45+)\n该-漏-洞-影-响-Win-dows-NT-平-台-上-的-Ci-s-co-安-全-访-问-控-制-服-务-器-产-品-，-攻-击-复-杂-度-低-，-CV-SS-评-分-为-10-分-，-危-害-等-级-严-重-。 (approx 40+)\n\nTotal is definitely over 50 Chinese characters.\n\nWait, I need to check if the current TOML has the description inside `\"\"\"` which might cause parsing issues. The skill says:\n\"禁止的段：... [description] ... —— 所有字段都必须放在 5 个合法段内，严禁将上述关键词创建为独立段\"\n\nSo `[description]` cannot be a standalone section. But the current TOML shows `description` is inside `[basic]` which is correct. The issue is that the value is empty.\n\nThe output format says: \"只有 <value> 和\n","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1054"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03Z","remediation":"升级 CiscoSecure ACS for Windows NT 到 2.4.2 或更高版本。如短期内无法升级，应在边界防火墙或路由器上限制对 TCP 2002 端口（CSAdmin 模块）的访问，仅允许可信管理网段来源 IP 连接，并在升级前禁用不必要的远程 CSAdmin 管理功能以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/csecureacsnt-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1705","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5272","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20235","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1054.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1054.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1054.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1054","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1054.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1054.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1054.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1054.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2000/CVE-2000-1054.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1054.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0765.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0764","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0764.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1053","title":"Allaire JRun 2.3.x JSP Servlet 跨站脚本远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Allaire JRun 2.3.x 服务器的 JSP Servlet 组件 com.livesoftware.jrun.plugins.jsp 存在跨站脚本攻击漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过跨站脚本攻击方式向服务器注入恶意 JSP 代码，并直接调用 com.livesoftware.jrun.plugins.JSP servlet 进行编译和执行，从而在服务器端执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Allaire JRun 2.3.x 系列版本，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在远程服务器上执行任意系统命令，完全控制目标服务器，造成严重的信息泄露、数据破坏及服务器沦陷风险。CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1053"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Allaire JRun 4.0 或更高版本，因为 JRun 2.3.x 已经停止维护且存在多个严重安全漏洞。可在官方网站下载最新版本（http://www.allaire.com/products/jrun）。升级后必须修改 JSP servlet 配置，禁用路径遍历功能，限制文件访问权限到 Web 根目录。使用绝对路径访问 JSP 文件，并确保部署的 JSP 文件经过彻底的安全扫描。此外，建议部署 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 过滤包含 \"/servlet/../\" 的恶意请求，并定期监控服务器日志以检测可疑的 JSP 编译行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97236125107957&w=2","http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=17969&Method=Full","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5406","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20314","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1053.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1053.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1053.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1053.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1053.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1053","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/a4e6f7600554ac8403f3ff05bd1db846165cce29/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-1053.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1053.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1053.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1053.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0764.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0764.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0764.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0762","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0762.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1050","title":"Allaire JRun 3 目录泄露漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Allaire JRun 3.0 是一款 Java Servlet 服务器。该服务器在处理 HTTP 请求时存在目录泄露漏洞。攻击者通过在请求路径的起始位置添加额外的斜杠（即\"前导斜杠\"），可绕过正常访问控制，直接访问服务器 WEB-INF 目录下的敏感文件。该目录通常存放 web.xml 配置文件、类文件及其他不应对外公开的应用程序资源。漏洞影响安装了 Allaire JRun 3.0 版本的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起利用，可导致敏感配置信息泄露，进而为后续攻击提供信息支持。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1050"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Allaire JRun 3.0 SP1 或更高版本，该版本修复了额外的斜杠导致的目录泄露漏洞。如无法立即升级，可通过Web应用服务器配置文件中禁用对WEB-INF目录的直接访问作为临时缓解措施。此外，确保禁用所有未使用的servlet并验证应用服务器的安全配置，防止路径遍历攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97236316510117&w=2","http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=17966&Method=Full","http://www.osvdb.org/500","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5407","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20313","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1050.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1050.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1050.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1050.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1050.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1050","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1050.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1050.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1050.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1050.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0762.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0762.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0762.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0761","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0761.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1046","title":"IBM Lotus Domino ESMTP 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-1046是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1046"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:02Z","remediation":"立即将 Lotus Domino 服务器升级至 5.0.4 或更高版本（5.0.4a、6.x、7.x 等），该版本已修复 ESMTP 服务在处理 RCPT TO、SAML FROM 及 SOML FROM 命令时的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如暂无法升级，应在边界防火墙或路由器上配置访问控制列表，仅允许可信来源 IP 访问 25 端口（SMTP），并启用 IDS/IPS 检测超长 SMTP 命令参数的攻击特征作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0093.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19944","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1046.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1046.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1046","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1046.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1046.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1046.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb5f9e7ddda132923d86346e273be6f1c71ee410/2000/CVE-2000-1046.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1046.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1046.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1046.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0761.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0759","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0759.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1037","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 会话代理字典攻击漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 Session Agent 3.0 至 4.1 版本存在认证绕过漏洞。该组件在身份验证时，对无效用户名和无效密码返回不同的错误消息，攻击者可通过远程发送认证请求并分析响应差异，枚举出系统中有效的用户名，进而使用字典攻击暴力破解密码，最终获取未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 3.0、4.0 及 4.1 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，对防火墙管理面安全造成严重威胁。Check Point 已在后续版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1037"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01Z","remediation":"立即将 Check Point Firewall-1 Session Agent 升级至 4.1 SP5 或更高版本，该版本已修复错误消息差异问题。如无法立即升级，应在边界防火墙或 ACL 中限制 TCP 261 端口的访问来源，仅允许可信管理网段访问 Session Agent，作为临时缓解措施。同时应启用强密码策略并定期审计防火墙会话认证日志，检测异常连接尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/76389","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1662","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20216","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4cd39de946c4dae2d75d1f265b016c2f29e5b92a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1037.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1037.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1037","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1037.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1037.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a3231978c760368f8f6b5637cdf1c49798e2fdc5/2000/CVE-2000-1037.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1037.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1037.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1037.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1037.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0759.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0758","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0758.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1036","title":"Extent Technologies RBS ISP 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Extent RBS ISP Web Server 2.5 存在目录遍历漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向服务器的 Image 参数注入路径遍历序列（如 .. ），突破 Web 根目录限制，读取服务器上的敏感文件。该漏洞影响该版本的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需凭证即可远程利用，成功后可泄露系统配置文件、密码文件或其他敏感数据。攻击条件简单，仅需目标运行受影响版本的 RBS ISP Web Server 并允许外部访问即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1036"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01Z","remediation":"Extent Technologies 已长期停止维护，官方未发布针对该漏洞的补丁。建议采取以下临时缓解措施：在防火墙或 ACL 中仅允许可信 IP 访问 TCP 8002 端口；在前端反向代理或 WAF 中配置规则，拦截所有包含 ../ 或 ..\\ 的 Image 参数请求；收紧 Web 服务器根目录的文件系统权限，禁止 Web 进程读取数据库等敏感文件；如条件允许，迁移到 Apache 或 Nginx 等持续受安全支持的 Web 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0252.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1704","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5275","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20234","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1036.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1036.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1036","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1036.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1036.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1036.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/feb3588b82c9620d09c69f65c4fe01c2dcf3dd03/2000/CVE-2000-1036.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1036.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1036.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1036.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0758.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0758.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0758.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0756","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0756.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1035","title":"TYPSoft FTP Server 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"标签包裹。<value>TYPSoft FTP Server 0.78及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标FTP服务发送超长构造的USER、PASS或CWD命令触发溢出，导致拒绝服务，并可能执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本的系统，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在远程发起攻击。CVSS评分为10分，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1035"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01Z","remediation":"TYPSoft FTP Server 0.78 及更早版本由于长时间命令导致缓冲区溢出，攻击者可以触发远程拒绝服务并可能执行任意命令。立即升级到 TYPSoft FTP Server 0.79 或更高版本，获取修复缓冲区溢漏洞的官方安全补丁。此外，建议限制FTP服务端口访问，配置防火墙策略以阻止异常长的数据包，部署缓冲区溢出保护机制，并定期监控FTP服务器日志以检测可疑攻击行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96879389027478&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1690","http://www.synnergy.net/Archives/Advisories/dethy/typsoft-ftpd.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20228","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1035.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1035.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1035","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1035.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1035.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1035.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/726a223a23a749274833ae3776326ca97dd305d1/2000/CVE-2000-1035.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1035.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1035.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1035.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0756.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0755","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0755.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1033","title":"Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 暴力破解漏洞","description":"Serv-U FTP Server 存在暴力破解漏洞，其反暴力破解（anti-hammering）防护机制存在设计缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可先以有效用户身份（可能利用匿名账户）登录 FTP 服务，随后针对其他用户账户发起密码猜测攻击，从而绕过防护限制实施暴力破解。该漏洞影响 Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 2.5.x 系列版本，攻击者无需额外权限即可在远程条件下反复尝试密码，成功后可获取其他用户账户的访问权限，导致敏感数据泄露或服务器被非法控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1033"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Serv-U FTP Server 从 2.5.x 版本升级到 3.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复反暴力破解机制绕过漏洞。同时，在服务器配置中禁用匿名登录（Anonymous Logon），仅允许授权用户访问。此外，在防火墙或路由器层面限制单 IP 在短时间内的 FTP 连接次数，并启用 Serv-U 的登录失败锁定功能，连续三次密码错误后自动禁用该账户一段时间。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/141905","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1860","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5436","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20334","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1033.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1033.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1033.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1033.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1033.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1033","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1033.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-1033.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1033.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1033.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0755.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0754","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0754.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1029","title":"ISC BIND 8.1 host 命令远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 8.1 的 host 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当远程攻击者向 BIND 域名服务器发起 AXFR（区域传输）查询时，服务器返回的过长响应数据可触发 host 命令中的缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响所有使用 ISC BIND 8.1 版本的 DNS 服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者可通过构造恶意的 DNS 响应数据包，在受影响的服务器上获得完全控制权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1029"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00Z","remediation":"建议将 ISC BIND 8.1 升级至 BIND 8.2.2 或更高版本，该版本修复了 host 命令处理 AXFR 查询响应时的缓冲区溢出问题。如条件允许，强烈建议直接迁移至 BIND 9.x 稳定版，因 BIND 8 系列已停止安全更新。作为临时缓解措施，可在 named.conf 中通过 allow-transfer 访问控制列表限制 zone transfer 仅对可信服务器开放，或禁用不必要的 AXFR 查询功能，同时在防火墙层过滤 53 端口的 TCP zone transfer 请求，以降低远程攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/141660","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1887","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5462","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20374","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1029.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1029.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1029","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1029.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1029.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1029.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/25203fd38febf163b5a0afeecde6a3effc609cec/2000/CVE-2000-1029.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1029.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1029.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1029.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0754.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0753","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0753.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1028","title":"HP HP-UX 11.0 cu 本地缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.0 系统中的 /bin/cu 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该程序在处理通过 -l 命令行参数指定的设备路径时，未能对输入长度进行有效边界检查，攻击者可传递超长字符串触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码。此漏洞仅影响本地已登录用户，攻击者无需额外身份验证即可在具有普通权限的账户下利用此漏洞获取 root 权限。利用方式为通过构造包含 shellcode 和偏移量的超长字符串作为 -l 参数调用 /bin/cu，覆盖函数返回地址并跳转至嵌入的 shellcode，最终获得系统最高权限。HP-UX 11.00 版本受此漏洞影响，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1028"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00Z","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 到 11.11 或更高版本（包含安全补丁），并应用最新的 HP-UX 安全更新。通过 HP-UX software configurator 或 HP-UX Manageability package禁用不必要的cu服务。使用sed脚本限制cu命令行参数长度，最大支持512字符。运行HP-UX Security Vault进行漏洞扫描，如发现权限提升风险则紧急修补。对-legacy应用程序进行程序代码审计，修正缓冲区溢出缺陷。使用execattr.conf配置用户执行权限，限制普通用户对/bin/cu的使用权限。如无法立即升级，可将cu命令从PATH中移除或设为不可执行，并部署HP-UX Intrusion Detection System进行持续监控。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/142792","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1886","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5460","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/245","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1028.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1028","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1028.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1028.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/25203fd38febf163b5a0afeecde6a3effc609cec/2000/CVE-2000-1028.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1028.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1028.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1028.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1028.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1028.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0753.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0752","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0752.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1027","title":"思科 PIX Firewall PASV模式FTP内部地址泄露漏洞","description":"Cisco PIX Firewall 5.2(2) 在处理 FTP 被动模式（PASV）请求时存在内部地址信息泄露漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务器发送大量 PASV 请求，在被动模式建立时获取服务器响应中携带的内部真实 IP 地址，从而泄露受保护网络内部的主机地址信息。该漏洞影响 Cisco Secure PIX Firewall 5.2(2) 版本，攻击者可利用此信息进一步发起针对内部网络的定向攻击。攻击条件为攻击者能够与目标 PIX 防火墙建立网络连接并发送 FTP PASV 请求，利用方式简单且无需任何认证凭据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1027"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cisco PIX Firewall 到支持安全修复的版本，建议安装 Cisco PIX Firewall 5.3 或更高版本，并启用受保护的 FTP 配置。通过 `fixup protocol ftp force-tcp` 命令强制 FTP 协商使用 TCP 连接，同时配置访问控制列表限制 PASV 命令的来源地址，防止攻击者发起 IP 地址泄露的 FTP 被动模式攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97059440000367&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/1623","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1877","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5646","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20369","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/52138c35bcb0784b4efb0e41fb1e599736d809a9/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1027.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1027.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1027","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1027.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1027.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/343a9c8af3f97395548d45562cf85cc26422f7cd/2000/CVE-2000-1027.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1027.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1027.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1027.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1027.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0752.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0750","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0750.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1026","title":"tcpdump 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tcpdump 3.4/3.5 版本在解析 AFS ACL（访问控制列表）数据包时存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，只需向运行 tcpdump 的目标主机发送特制的 AFS ACL 数据包，即可触发缓冲区溢出。由于 tcpdump 通常以 root 权限运行（需要 root 权限打开网络接口进行数据包捕获），溢出成功后可导致栈上变量被覆盖，进而实现远程代码执行，完全获取目标主机的 root 权限。该漏洞影响运行 tcpdump 3.4 和 3.5 的 Unix/Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1026"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59Z","remediation":"建议升级 tcpdump 到 3.6 或更高版本（如 4.99.1+），可通过包管理器安装：apt-get update && apt-get install tcpdump（Debian/Ubuntu）或 yum update tcpdump（RHEL/CentOS）。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面阻断非受信网络的 AFS 协议流量（UDP 7000-7007），并限制 tcpdump 仅在受信网络接口上运行（使用 -i 参数指定接口），禁用 AFS 解析功能（-A 参数避免解析 AFS 包）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q4/0681.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1870","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5480","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20337","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1026.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1026.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1026","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1026.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1026.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1026.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1026.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1026.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1026.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/15dc4562a27a859de217929d811811b842ebac90/2000/CVE-2000-1026.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0750.toml"}]